  "cues": [
    {
      "time": 0,
      "page": 0,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.07
      ],
      "width": 0.23
    },
    {
      "time": 3,
      "page": 0,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "这是哪里？\n我怎么会在这里？",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.07
      ],
      "width": 0.39
    },
    {
      "time": 9,
      "page": 0,
      "panel": 1,
      "text": "这双爪子……\n还有尾巴？",
      "position": [
        0.59,
        0.05
      ],
      "width": 0.36
    },
    {
      "time": 14,
      "page": 0,
      "panel": 2,
      "text": "原来，我是一只猫。",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.64
      ],
      "width": 0.37,
      "meow": true
    },
    {
      "time": 18,
      "page": 1,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "好大的房间。\n静得……只剩我的脚步声。",
      "position": [
        0.035,
        0.07
      ],
      "width": 0.4
    },
    {
      "time": 24,
      "page": 1,
      "panel": 1,
      "text": "啊……我想起来了。\n我有一个主人。",
      "position": [
        0.035,
        0.66
      ],
      "width": 0.36
    },
    {
      "time": 30,
      "page": 2,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "我最喜欢她了。\n听见她回来，我就会跑过去。",
      "position": [
        0.035,
        0.07
      ],
      "width": 0.41
    },
    {
      "time": 35,
      "page": 2,
      "panel": 1,
      "text": "可是，她生病了。\n连摸我的手，都没什么力气。",
      "position": [
        0.025,
        0.8
      ],
      "width": 0.41
    },
    {
      "time": 41,
      "page": 3,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "以前都是她照顾我。\n这一次，换我来。",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.09
      ],
      "width": 0.39
    },
    {
      "time": 45,
      "page": 3,
      "panel": 0,
      "text": "我记得……在这里，\n我就能学会照顾她。",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.09
      ],
      "width": 0.39
    },
    {
      "time": 49,
      "page": 3,
      "panel": 1,
      "text": "总之，先看看房间里有什么。",
      "position": [
        0.04,
        0.67
      ],
      "width": 0.43
    }
  ]
